'''X-Files''' (サイエンスフィクション, ''Saiensu Fikushon'', '''Science Fiction''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

==Effect==
'''Current Version''': Cannon Power UP (Sm): Cannon attack power increases by 20%.

'''Pre 4.7''': Worker Cat Start Level UP (Sm): Worker Cat's initial level starts with +1.

